# Accepted findings of `trivy image` (HIGH and CRITICAL with a fix upstream).
# One finding per line with its reason above it and an expiry that forces a
# new decision. Only findings this project cannot fix belong here: a version
# pinned by Arches or served by Arches' npm dependencies. A finding the
# project can fix (a floor in pyproject.toml, a bump in package.json) is fixed.
